        <div class="hero-avatar-frame">
          <img src="assets/images/main-images/maroof-hero-new-booth-edited.webp" alt="Maroof Lone"
            class="hero-avatar-img" fetchpriority="high" width="750" height="667">
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content & Bio -->
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-header-block">
          <h1 class="hero-title">Hi, I'm Maroof <span class="wave">👋</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-role">Computer Science Engineer, Web Developer &amp; Researcher</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-bio-text">
          <p>
            I build fast, accessible web applications and investigate the digital landscape through open-source
            intelligence (OSINT). Deeply curious about the intersection of code, cybersecurity, and media.
          </p>
          <p>
            My focus is creating software and research that makes the internet more reliable, safe, and transparent.
            When I'm away from the terminal, I write essays on technology, society, and ideas worth sharing.
          </p>
        </div>

